---
pagination:
  data: homeworks
  size: 1
  alias: hw
permalink: "homework_{{ hw.numberStr }}.html"
layout: base.njk
tags: homework
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Homework {{ hw.numberStr }} (5 pts.)"
icon: fa-book
navigation:
  - name: "Home"
    link: "index.html"
    icon: "fa-gavel"
---

{% set assignment_name = hw.assignmentName %}
{% set assignment_display = hw.assignmentDisplay %}
{% set document_link = hw.link %}

<h2>Task 1: Notebook</h2>

<p>Open the assignment in Google Colab, save a copy to your Drive, and complete the questions and code cells in the notebook.</p>

{% if document_link %}
<div class="alert alert-success">
<a href="{{ document_link }}">OPEN NOTEBOOK IN GOOGLE COLAB</a>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if not document_link %}
<div class="alert alert-warning">
<p>Notebook link not yet available. Please check back later.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if hw.previewBase %}
<p>For your convenience the notebook is displayed below as HTML, but you will likely
find it easier to copy the notebook from the Google Colab link above.</p>

<div class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3">
<iframe
    class="embed-responsive-item course-embed theme-notebook-frame"
    width="100%"
    height="800"
    src="{{ hw.previewBase }}-light.html"
    data-src-light="{{ hw.previewBase }}-light.html"
    data-src-dark="{{ hw.previewBase }}-dark.html"></iframe>
</div>
{% else %}
<div class="alert alert-warning">
<p>Rendered notebook preview not yet available. Use the Google Colab link above.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<pre style="display: none;" id="dr-container" class="codehilite"><code id="dredd-response"></code></pre>

<h2>Task 2: Assignment Submission Instructions</h2>

<p>Follow the notebook's final export instructions, then upload the generated HTML file to Canvas.</p>
